{"4006130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Under The Rooftop", "steam_appid": 4006130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006130/extras/1c9313f8b3bf5ddc61d2b7a4543d4df5.avif?t=1788002215\" width=1232 height=706 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Datura City, a snow-covered metropolis sealed off after a catastrophic outbreak.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Under the Rooftop</i> blends the tense gameplay of  survival horror genre with the depth of cooperative survival crafting. Explore apartments, hospitals, police stations, shopping malls, and underground facilities using a Gate-and-Key-style progression system, where keys, tools, and discoveries unlock new areas and challenges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop Base-Building</strong> – Build, expand, and fortify your home base on rooftops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gate and Key Exploration</strong> – Unlock new rooms, buildings, and underground areas with keys, tools, and progression.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Resource Scavenging</strong> – Dismantle anything in buildings and underground facilities for materials.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Aggro System</strong> – Enemies hunt by sound, smell, and light, making every movement and action a risk.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Survival Stats</strong> – Manage smell, noise, hunger, thirst, and body temperature to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Combat</strong> – Combine melee and ranged combat with traps, stealth, and diversion tactics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rooftop Wave Defense</strong> – Defend your base against waves of infected raining down from the sky.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op Multiplayer</strong> – Survive with up to 4 players through teamwork and role division.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NPC Companions</strong> – Recruit specialists like the Doctor, Architect, Chef, and Weapon Master to unlock new survival options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weather &amp; Environment</strong> – Endure snow, storms, rain, and darkness as the city’s harsh winter constantly shifts survival conditions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Boss Encounters</strong> – Face horrifying bosses tied to major landmarks and underground domains, each requiring teamwork and strategy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets Deep Below</strong> – Descend into sewers, subways, luxury ruins, corporate labs, and cathedrals where the darkest truths are buried.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006130/extras/c4c700bc4290b1bd5a3911699c516d5e.poster.avif?t=1788002215\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006130/extras/c4c700bc4290b1bd5a3911699c516d5e.webm?t=1788002215\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4006130/extras/ae82c9f916e3130a8694ffad369899ba.poster.avif?t=1788002215\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse